  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Building a Climate for Peace</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a Climate for Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">(1) F&#xf6;rderung und Durchf&#xfc;hrung von Dialog- und Kommunikationsformaten, insb. durch Fortf&#xfc;hrung der j&#xe4;hrlichen Konferenzreihe &#x201e;Berlin Climate and Security Conferences&#x201c;; (2) Pflege des Climate Security Expert Networks&#x201c; und weiterf&#xfc;hrende wissenschaftliche Analysen (Policy Papers) zu Schwerpunktregionen (3) Wissensvermittlung an Entscheidungstr&#xe4;ger:innen und &#xd6;ffentlichkeit/Capacity Building im Bereich Klima und Sicherheit bei f&#xfc;r die BReg wichtigen Akteuren z.B. in den Bereichen Entwicklungszusammenarbeit, ziviles Krisenmanagement, Verteidigung; (4) F&#xf6;rderung der Climate for Peace Initiative</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(1) Support and implementation of platforms of dialogue and communication, especially by continuing the annual conference series &quot;Berlin Climate and Security Conferences&quot;; (2) Maintenance of the &quot;Climate Security Expert Network&quot; and advanced scientific analysis (policy papers) regarding core regions; (3) Knowledge transfer to policymakers and public/capacity building concerning climate and security for main actors which are relevant for the Federal Government in the following areas: development cooperation, civil crisis management, defense; (4) Support of the Climate for Peace Initiative</narrative>
  </description>
